  "content": "<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/boUavhPr/images/59ff2b0a91fb5abe2a66b6434596ce7e2ec3bbad.png\" alt=\"横幅\">\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/793/503/_x__xampp_htdocs_mrcrayfish.png\"> \n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/793/501/_x__xampp_htdocs_mrcrayfish.png\"> \n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/793/502/_x__xampp_htdocs_mrcrayfish.png\">\n</p>\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n\n### 📖 介绍：\n**MrCrayfish 的家具模组工具：重制版** 模组为来自 [**MrCrayfish 的家具模组：重制版**](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/refurbished-furniture) 中的方块新增了 3 种实用工具！\n\n---\n\n### 🛠️ 工具：\n\n\n**<span style=\"color:#3498db\">旋转工具</span>**\n\n**<span style=\"color:#e67e22\">破坏工具</span>**\n\n**<span style=\"color:#e74c3c\">多功能工具</span>**\n\n</div>\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/MrPup-minecraftkus/MrCrayfishs-Furniture-Mod-Tools-Refurbished/refs/heads/test/1214.gif\" alt=\"工具展示\">\n</p>",
